摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Apify plugin for the DeepSeek harness","id":"gh:1354530925","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"apify-deepseek-harness-plugin","slug":"apify/apify-deepseek-harness-plugin","topics":["agent-skills","apify","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","mcp","web-scraping"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Apify plugin for the DeepSeek harness"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# Apify plugin for DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Search, run, and build Apify Actors directly from DeepSeek Harness."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"## What you get"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"| Component | Name | Purpose | Needs |"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"| Skill (entry point) | `apify` | Routes each Apify request to the right skill or tool. | - |\n| MCP "},{"id":"p6s2","text":"server | `apify` (`https://mcp.apify.com/`) | Searches Apify Store, fetches Actor details and docs. "},{"id":"p6s3","text":"With a token it also runs Actors and reads their results. | `APIFY_TOKEN` to run Actors |\n| Skill | "},{"id":"p6s4","text":"`apify-ultimate-scraper` | Multi-step scraping workflows across 15+ platforms. | Apify CLI |\n| Skill"},{"id":"p6s5","text":" | `apify-actor-development` | Creates, tests, and deploys a new Actor. | Apify CLI |\n| Skill | `api"},{"id":"p6s6","text":"fy-actorization` | Turns an existing project into an Actor. | Apify CLI |\n| Skill | `apify-generate-"},{"id":"p6s7","text":"output-schema` | Generates output schemas for an existing Actor from its source code. | - |\n| Skill "},{"id":"p6s8","text":"| `apify-sdk-integration` | Adds Actor runs to your own app with the `apify-client` package. | `APIF"},{"id":"p6s9","text":"Y_TOKEN` in your app |"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Skills load when a request matches them, or run one directly as `/<skill-name>`. Skills marked \"Apif"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"y CLI\" need the Apify CLI installed and logged in."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Before you start"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"- **Node.js `^22.23.4 || >=24.22.1`.** On older versions, `dsh` exits without printing anything.\n- *"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"*pnpm on PATH.** `dsh plugin` forwards to it.\n- **An Apify API token** from Apify Console (free acco"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"unts work). Without a token only search/inspect tools load. If you already use the logged-in Apify C"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"LI, the agent can run Actors through it instead (requires **Full access** sandbox mode)."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Plugins are installed per `dsh` profile. Use the profile you run:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Add your token to a `.env` file where you launch dsh:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Restart `dsh`. It reads the token once at startup, so a token set during a session has no effect."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Verify"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Start a new session and ask:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"> List the Apify skills and the `mcp__apify__` tools you can use."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"You should see the six skills above. With a token, the tools include `mcp__apify__call-actor`. Witho"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"ut one, you get only `search-actors`, `fetch-actor-details`, `search-apify-docs`, and `fetch-apify-d"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"e, you get only `search-actors`, `fetch-actor-details`, `search-apify-docs`, and `fetch-apify-docs`."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Try it"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"> Use Apify to find a good Actor for scraping Google Maps reviews. Show me its input schema and pric"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"d a good Actor for scraping Google Maps reviews. Show me its input schema and pricing. Don't run it."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"> Use Apify to scrape the top 10 Google search results for \"web scraping best practices\" and summari"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"ze what they have in common."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Override either bundle row by `id` from your profile's `cordis.patch.yml`. See `cordis.patch.yml` in"},{"id":"p24s2","text":" this repo for the full default. To change which tools load, edit the `tools=` query parameter in th"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"e MCP URL (docs, visual picker)."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Troubleshooting"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"**`invalid_token` on startup.** Token is set but wrong. Fix it and restart."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"**The agent says it cannot run an Actor.** You're in discovery-only mode. Set `APIFY_TOKEN` and rest"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"e agent says it cannot run an Actor.** You're in discovery-only mode. Set `APIFY_TOKEN` and restart."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"**npm reports root-owned files and suggests `sudo chown`.** The default **Workspace Write** sandbox "},{"id":"p28s2","text":"blocks writes outside your workspace, including the npm cache in `~/.npm`, and npm reports that as a"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"n ownership problem. `sudo chown` doesn't help, so reject any prompt to run it. To get past the erro"},{"id":"p28s4","text":"r, run the command that failed (such as `apify create` or `npm install`) yourself in the workspace d"},{"id":"p28s5","text":"irectory and let the agent continue. Approving the agent's escalation or switching to **Full access*"},{"id":"p28s6","text":"* also works, but it gives the agent unrestricted access to your whole system, so do that only if yo"},{"id":"p28s7","text":"u trust the model, or run `dsh` in a container or VM."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"**The plugin seems out of date or missing.** Check that you installed it into the profile you're run"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"ning. Each profile has its own copy."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## Remove"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"**Note:** Actor runs consume Apify usage on top of model provider costs."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"## Links"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"- Apify Store · Apify MCP server · Apify docs\n- DeepSeek Harness · Plugin packaging docs\n- Issues an"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"ore · Apify MCP server · Apify docs\n- DeepSeek Harness · Plugin packaging docs\n- Issues and feedback"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"Apache-2.0. See LICENSE."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
